00:26:18.300 --> 00:26:19.760
Uh, you know, I'm always here for that.

00:26:19.940 --> 00:26:26.800
It seems like sports games in, on the NES, almost all like must have a watch mode, which kind of makes sense, right?

00:26:26.840 --> 00:26:28.540
It's no different than watching sports on TV.

00:26:28.540 --> 00:26:30.460
