Um, what I really wanted to get into about talking about these different modes is the, the tournament component of the one

00:26:39.460 --> 00:26:44.380
player mode and how that's not really like, they don't really building it to anything.

00:26:44.380 --> 00:26:47.160
And I, I think they're crazy for expecting people to play.

00:26:47.380 --> 00:26:54.120
I can't remember if it's 24 or 32 rounds of a tournament with only eight teams in an entire

