So none of these like little quirks that they build into the teams matter from a gameplay

00:27:16.000 --> 00:27:21.940
perspective. So it's just all, um, useless in the tournament mode.

00:27:22.140 --> 00:27:27.000
Uh, essentially it's like a record keeping thing if you really wanted to have it, but otherwise

00:27:27.000 --> 00:27:31.840
you're better off, uh, just going into, uh, like a, an exhibition match.

